// after the switch, so that arm carries TWO case labels, exactly the
// doubled 0/6 entry retail's jump table shows - then 4561 the miss
// test, 4567 `choose_wall_target` INSIDE it, and 4569 the tail call to
// the private (TWallTargetId, long) overload one brace out. Retail
// inlines the chooser and keeps everything else in that order.
//
